{"summary":"Epic 3D RTS: Conquer or defend in interplanetary war.","description":"Conquer or Defend! Dive into the epic 3D RTS action of War for Terra. Command powerful armies, build sprawling bases, and wage interplanetary war in this immersive real-time strategy experience. Will you lead the technologically superior invaders in their conquest of Terra, or rally humanity's defenses and push back the alien threat?\n\nAs a true RTS aficionado, you'll appreciate the depth and strategic nuances War for Terra offers: meticulously crafted units with unique abilities, resource management challenges, and dynamic battlefield tactics. Forge your strategy, outmaneuver your opponent, and claim victory!\n\nWar for Terra delivers a premium, ad-free, and purchase-free RTS gaming experience, including:\n\n• Immersive Stylized 3D Graphics: Immerse yourself in a vibrant and detailed sci-fi world.\n• Intuitive RTS Controls: Command your armies with ease, designed for seamless mobile gameplay.\n• Dual Campaigns: Experience both sides of the conflict with unique missions and storylines as the invaders or defenders of Terra.\n• Local Multiplayer: Challenge your friends to intense RTS showdowns.\n• Challenging AI: Hone your skills against cunning AI opponents.\n• Premium Experience: Enjoy uninterrupted gameplay with absolutely no ads or in-app purchases.\n\nDownload War for Terra today and experience the thrill of real-time strategy warfare!\n\nGood luck and have fun!","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KqR7TlQqCP0?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1wO4groBfUMDdaYslm_pfuSgH5JmaIxvPZOyIANEfywX0ZDg7TqaynWjEGcwhAuitbrl7OnjfWKTgpLCOEzOmmk","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tLZNUmETgIl6LRe03B5-x1dj__npGZK4O9Zl-PabVidMxIfcV6AjiniWTIAILD5WL-IehZ8sXJowpUxKiFvL_Ng","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1HiVVAyeUsWbHLlEBPBXIB33vnKFdEiagcOYMEu